# Phase 4 - Synchronization and Explicit Resource States

References:
- [Resource State Model](../planning/subsystems/resource-state-model.md)
- [Synchronization](../planning/subsystems/synchronization.md)
- [Resource System](../planning/subsystems/resource-system.md)
- [Diagnostics and Tooling](../planning/subsystems/diagnostics-and-tooling.md)

## Phase 4.1: Access state tracking
Docs: [Resource State Model](../planning/subsystems/resource-state-model.md)
- [ ] Implement the canonical access state set and validation rules.
- [ ] Track per-subresource access states for textures.
- [ ] Track access states for buffers.
- [ ] Track pipeline scope ownership per resource or subresource.
- [ ] Implement validation-only tracked state updates (no barrier required).
- [ ] Enforce invalid access mix detection in validation.

## Phase 4.2: Transitions and barriers
Docs: [Resource State Model](../planning/subsystems/resource-state-model.md), [Synchronization](../planning/subsystems/synchronization.md), [Resource System](../planning/subsystems/resource-system.md)
- [ ] Implement transition objects and begin/end transition commands.
- [ ] Handle discard/clear flags and transient aliasing rules.
- [ ] Integrate logical barrier behavior on OpenGL.
- [ ] Batch transitions and elide redundant barriers where safe.
- [ ] Integrate pooled allocator aliasing metadata into transition validation.

## Phase 4.3: Fences and cross-queue sync
Docs: [Synchronization](../planning/subsystems/synchronization.md)
- [ ] Implement timeline-style fences with binary fallback.
- [ ] Implement explicit signal/wait ordering across pipelines.
- [ ] Validate cross-queue dependencies at submit time.

## Phase 4.4: Diagnostics integration
Docs: [Diagnostics and Tooling](../planning/subsystems/diagnostics-and-tooling.md)
- [ ] Emit barrier and transition events into diagnostics.
- [ ] Surface validation errors with resource names and contexts.
- [ ] Capture GPU crash breadcrumbs when supported.
